OL,3,GNEWSAWoman furious about early release
OL,4,Afor driver who killed her husband
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman has criticised the early
OL,7,Frelease and deportation of her
OL,8,Fhusband's killer, just over
OL,9,Ffour-and-a-half years into his jail
OL,10,Fterm.
OL,12,FHighways worker Kevin Jarvis, 57, was
OL,13,Fdue to finish his night shift in a
OL,14,Fconed-off area of the M6 in
OL,15,FStaffordshire in February 2022 when his
OL,16,Fparked vehicle was hit by Denis Balaz.
OL,18,FHe had been driving at 120mph in a Audi
OL,19,FA8 he had stolen from the West
OL,20,FMidlands.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
